# Task Log Maintenance

- After every code change, append one concise entry to `TASK-LOG.md` under `## Ongoing Time Log`.
- Entry format:
 `- YYYY-MM-DD | Scope: <scope> | Started: <HH:MM> | Finished: <HH:MM> | Duration: <duration> | Status: <local|deployed> | Result: <result>.`
- Include only meaningful changes (features, fixes, regressions, migrations, deploy-impacting edits).
- Do not rewrite or delete historical entries unless explicitly requested.
- If multiple small edits belong to one task, combine into one single log entry.
- If exact timing is unavailable, use `n/a` for Started/Finished/Duration.
- Before final response, verify that the current task is logged.
